Usage: az session <start|attach|stop|status|diagnose> [arguments]

Commands:
  start <ticket-id>      Start a session for a ticket
  attach <ticket-id>     Attach to an existing ticket session
  stop <ticket-id>       Stop a ticket session via daemon-authoritative stopped state
  status [ticket-id]     Show all sessions or one ticket session status
  diagnose <ticket-id>  Collect session, worktree, operation, hook, and log diagnostics

Deprecated aliases:
  kill <ticket-id>      Alias for stop
